--- qa_process_flow
step | task | description | input_source | output_format | priority
1 | Analyze_Changes | Review git diff and commits | git diff, git log | changes_summary | high
2 | Identify_Features | Determine new functionality | Commit history | feature_list | high
3 | Design_TestCases | Create testing scenarios | Feature analysis | test_cases | high
4 | Document_CriticalPoints | List critical aspects | Code review | critical_list | high
5 | Check_Regressions | Identify prev. behaviors | Change impact | regression_list | high
6 | Format_Output | Create markdown summary | All above | markdown_file | medium

--- qa_summary_sections
section | markdown_header | content | source | format | required
Problem_Solved | 🎯 Problema Resuelto | Brief problem description | Git commits | Plain text | true
Implemented_Features | ⚙️ Funcionalidad Implementada | List of features and improvements | Code analysis | Bullet points | true
Test_Cases | 🧪 Casos de Prueba para QA | Step-by-step test scenarios | Feature review | Numbered steps | true
Critical_Points | 🔍 Puntos Críticos a Verificar | Technical aspects to verify | Tech review | Bullet points | true
Regressions | 🚫 Regresiones a Verificar | Previous behaviors to preserve | Behavior analysis | Bullet points | true

--- test_case_structure
element | description | example | format | required
Case_Name | Descriptive name | Crear nuevo usuario | [Nombre descriptivo] | true
Steps | Numbered action sequence | 1. Click button, 2. Enter data | Numbered list | true
Expected_Result | Verification criteria | ✅ Usuario creado exitosamente | Result statement | true
Precondition | Required state before test | Usuario no autenticado | Pre-step | false
Postcondition | State after test | Base de datos actualizada | Post-step | false

--- critical_verification_points
category | aspect | example | priority | verify_type
Performance | Timings | API response < 500ms | high | Metrics
Persistence | Data Storage | Data saved to database | high | Functional
UX_UI | User Experience | Button colors correct | medium | Visual
Compatibility | Browser/Device | Works on mobile/desktop | high | Compatibility
Security | Authentication | Only authed users access | high | Security
Accessibility | A11y | Screen reader compatible | medium | Accessibility
Error_Handling | Validation | Proper error messages | high | Functional

--- regression_verification_checklist
item | feature | impact_level | affects_module | verification_method
Existing_Auth | User authentication | critical | auth | Test login flow
Existing_Forms | Form validation | high | forms | Submit valid/invalid data
Existing_API | API endpoints | critical | services | Call existing endpoints
Existing_UI | UI components | high | ui | Visual verification
Existing_Workflows | User workflows | critical | flows | Execute user journeys
Existing_Permissions | Permission system | critical | security | Test access control
Existing_Performance | System speed | medium | performance | Load testing
